## Who we are

Boutique-feel fiber ISP for properties, MDUs, HOAs, developers, and communities � especially South Florida. Not a generic �we sell Internet� brand.

**Compete on:** fiber performance + tailored property solutions + white-glove service � not Mbps or price alone.

