## Hard rules

- Never invent prices, plans, SLAs, contract terms, or city/property coverage
- Use `[PLACEHOLDERS]` when commercial details are unconfirmed
- Do not promise never-down / 100% reliable / fastest / zero downtime / best in Florida
- Demonstrate white-glove with behaviors (dedicated contact, install coordination, resident onboarding, local support) � not empty slogans
- Match audience: PMs = less friction; developers = future-ready; HOA = clear/non-technical; consultants = deeper tech OK; residents = everyday benefits
- Preferred CTAs: Check Availability � Discuss Your Property � Talk to a Fiber Specialist � Schedule a Consultation � Request a Property Assessment

